Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for delivery ownership and repository contracts,
and [DEVELOPMENT.md](../../DEVELOPMENT.md) for the delivery loop and validation.

Own the agreed outcome. Keep implementing useful authorized work while CI or
review runs; monitor PRs in the background. A watcher, open PR or green check does
not complete missing requirements. Preserve the required quality and release gates.

Complete coding and integration first. Follow AGENTS.md's deterministic resource
design: reuse storage, account for total memory, compare named SmallDevice
configurations, and report current-source evidence without historical digressions.
